ghts against the monsters that appear on the island, and ends up saving Kouichi after he gets attacked by one. She wears her school uniform even during her summer vacation because of the \"school's rules\"."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c52250"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"島の学校に通う２年生。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"島に出没する「怪物」と死闘を続けている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"康一にとっては命の恩人でもある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"刀を手にしているため無骨な雰囲気があるが、性格はおとなしいタイプ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"口調や態度は、年齢不相応なほどに堅いとところがある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"夏休みにもかかわらず、制服を着ている理由は、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「校則でそう決められているから」。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"11813","sourceWorkId":"24208","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"島の学園に通う 2年生。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"島に出没する “怪物” と死闘を続けている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"康一にとっては命の恩人でもある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"刀を手にしているため無骨な雰囲気があるが、性格はおとなしいタイプ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"口調や態度は年齢不相応なほどに堅いところがある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"夏休みにも関わらず制服を着ている理由は、“校則でそう決められているから” 。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"46321"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/19/1943600434646c8885eeb37d33c714b454c2e7e691233408d2956169bcc8c593.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/8e/8ebb52c1c3f51833dbc220d47c2e272f9cdbe33b391e2e6f8e90e5659fe9c8f4.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"天海玖美","creatorId":"vndb:s2832","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s2832","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s2832","name":"天海 玖美","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:192005:46321:15998:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c52251","characterName":"御城 由乃","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"46322","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"192005"}],"egsCharacterIds":["11814"],"vndbCharacterId":"c52251"},"originalCharacterName":"御城 由乃","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Kouichi's younger sister who is also Komako's classmate and friend. She acts and looks quite young, and has an innocent personality. She has always liked her older brother, so she is thrilled that Kouichi is coming back to the island."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"In one timeline, she is Kouichi's real younger sister and died by falling off from a cliff and didn't know Kyouko. In another timeline, she knows about Kyouko and considers her as her best friend or fated person, but didn't know about Kouichi at all. She is \"an ancient being\" like Kyouko but completely different from the original perspective, and this \"ancient being\" is Yuno in the story from prologue, main route and her route (except all her past person from protagonist's point of view)."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c52251"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"康一の妹。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"駒子のクラスメートで、仲良しという間柄。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"見た目も言動も少々幼く、良く言えば天真爛漫な女の子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"幼い頃からお兄ちゃん子で、康一が島を出てからは、 彼の帰省を何よりも心待ちにしている。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"11814","sourceWorkId":"24208","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"康一の妹。 駒子のクラスメイトで、仲良しという間柄。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"見た目も言動も少々幼く、良く言えば天真爛漫な女の子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"幼い頃からお兄ちゃん子で、島を出た康一の帰省を何よりも心待ちにしている。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"46322"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/f4/f47cab5a1c1e87e9e9a8e7a5004e56283e02a88375f8a8a5db7234828188f802.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/54/54d3a2eeda23371bda52f534086dd8398c13d74c34a1d329af5b653e66b32a7e.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"長妻樹里","creatorId":"vndb:s1197","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1197","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1197","name":"長妻 樹里","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:192005:46322:8493:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c52253","characterName":"真渋 恵里","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"46323","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"192005"}],"egsCharacterIds":["11815"],"vndbCharacterId":"c52253"},"originalCharacterName":"真渋 恵里","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"An independent and young detective who manages a detective agency all by herself. She hires Kouichi as her part-time assistant and goes to the island in order to investigate a request from Asuma Kunikazu to find his 24-year old friend Tsuboi Manami (坪井 愛実) before July 27. Eri has special powers that can aid her with her detective work, however she avoids using them as much as she can."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c52253"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"探偵。まだ若いが、独立して仕事をしている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"たった二人きりの探偵事務所の所長。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"バイトの助手は主人公である。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"島に住む“遊馬”と名乗る女性から奇妙な依頼を受け、 久々に故郷の島に帰ることになった。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ある特異な能力があり、それが探偵業において役に立っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"が、本人はその能力をあまり使いたがらない。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"11815","sourceWorkId":"24208","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"たった二人きりの探偵事務所の所長。 バイトの助手は主人公。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"まだ若いが独立しており、今回は島に住む “遊馬” と名乗る女性から奇妙な依頼を受け、久々に故郷の島へ帰ることに。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ある特異な能力があり、それが探偵業において役に立っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"だが、本人はその能力をあまり使いたがらない。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterI